"kind":"say","source_node_id":"1","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421215001","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"根据斐利尔大人的笔记中所说，两份月光兰的露水和一份盛放...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1421215002:1":{"key":"say:2:1421215002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421215002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"材料已经收集完毕了，<style=stress><pl...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:3:1421215002":{"key":"choice_prompt:3:1421215002","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1421215002","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"材料已经收集完毕了，<style=stress><player_name></style>大人，熬制药剂的事情就拜托你了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:4:177:0":{"key":"document:4:177:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"太神奇了！我今天发现了枯枯藤的秘密！\n原本以为枯萎的藤蔓会变得脆弱，但它们反而更坚韧。\n比金属还要结实，连火焰都烧不坏！\n我用这些藤蔓编织了一道门，它会永远守护我的小林地！\n不过，我还是得留个进出的办法。\n用一个特殊药剂如何？\n<align=\"right\">——斐利尔</align>\n\n（一部分后续补充的笔迹）\n附录：消融药剂配方\n<style=\"highlight\">·盛放的蚀芯花（越新鲜越好）</style>\n<style=\"highlight\">·月光兰的露水*2</style>\n药剂要现配现用，保质期很短！","textdes_id":"177","document_page_count":"1","document_t